sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as Merchant
    participant A as Acceptor PSP
    participant W as Wero / EPI context
    participant C as Consumer PSP
    participant H as Payment Hub
    participant R as SCT Inst / CSM
    participant B as Beneficiary PSP

    rect rgb(224,242,254)
      M->>A: Create payment request
      A->>W: Payment request / initiation context
      W->>C: Customer authorization journey
    end

    rect rgb(237,233,254)
      C->>H: Authorized payment intent
      H->>R: Financial instruction
      R->>B: Instant payment
      B-->>R: Authoritative result
      R-->>H: Financial status
    end

    rect rgb(220,252,231)
      H-->>C: Financial result
      C-->>W: Payment result
      W-->>A: Coordination / status event
      A-->>M: Signed webhook / status
    end

    Note over M,A: Merchant order state remains separate from financial state
    Note over H,B: Timeout after possible effect → UNKNOWN + reconciliation, not blind retry
